{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-1-41","kind":"proposition","title":"同底同高时平行四边形面积是三角形的两倍","englishTitle":"If a parallelogram have the same base with a triangle and be in the same parallels, the parallelogram is double of the triangle.","book":1,"number":41,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":41,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","contentId":"euclid-1-41","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a495e4e0dd65f3dcb96d35d3777a1b6635b98c1f5f5adcf40513af560ef47899","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-1-41.statement","euclid-1-41.construction.1","euclid-1-41.proof.1","euclid-1-41.construction.2","euclid-1-41.proof.2","euclid-1-41.proof.3","euclid-1-41.proof.4","euclid-1-41.conclusion","euclid-1-41.historical.1","euclid-1-41.historical.2","euclid-1-41.historical.3","euclid-1-41.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-1-41.statement","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"668469260a741f5cd01bdeb6eded2af5f05081f8e20429e2a648d7624e7406b2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If a parallelogram have the same base with a triangle and be in the same parallels, the parallelogram is double of the triangle."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果平行四边形有一个相同的底边 与三角形并列, 平行四边形 是三角形的两倍。"},{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有一平行方形一三角形同底则方形倍大于三角形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两条平行线之间，有一个平行四边形和一个底相同的三角形。如果正方形是三角形的两倍，"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7b114fab7ad9fcfecb0b0bb1784e982bccca87daa2fcd02593f622534b9f9c1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let the parallelogram ABCD have the same base BC with the triangle EBC, and let it be in the same parallels BC, AE;"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"330 ABCD的三角形EBC为底边 BC,并同时BC AE;"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cd5570e215025e73d5883829179b90cd5d985b09aab44c70b5c3808086db12ca","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say that the parallelogram ABCD is double of the triangle BEC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我说平行四边形、ABCD是三角形BEC的两倍（相关点与线段：ABCD）"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f365827205625f2ebdea19580833b3f8bbef4619373b8ee40b18e2f00a057114","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let AC be joined."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"AC连接我们"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f7dc5c95828ea113ceb6d722d2280a055ec1d0918baaa5efbad79ac155836ec7","citations":["euclid-1-37"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then the triangle ABC is equal to the triangle EBC; for it is on the same base BC with it and in the same parallels BC, AE. [[I. 37](/principles/euclid-1-37)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"三角形ABC等于三角形EBC; 三角形在底边 BC上, 平行于BC, AE。 [[I. 37](/principles/euclid-1-37)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e687e54236ad0064d180635055cf0f9606aa49dfff2cb562af77762b95c62bff","citations":["euclid-1-34"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the parallelogram ABCD is double of the triangle ABC; for the diameter AC bisects it; [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)] so that the parallelogram ABCD is also double of the triangle EBC."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但平行四边形 ABCD是三角形ABC的两倍;对角线AC的两部分是它;因此,平行四边形 ABCD也是三角形EBC的两倍。 [[I. 34](/principles/euclid-1-34)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":7,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a767bacf26447ac75c1864eb85eb90c16406ee2f0184be6b8ee076c3e1a38d5c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证毕。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.historical.1","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":8,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fa1ee4846706cd402ae4631abce8d58de37493d6ae7c1a50a054260320f9d6cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"两平行线内有一平行方形一三角形同底则方形倍大于三角形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"在两条平行线之间，有一个平行四边形和一个底相同的三角形。如果正方形是三角形的两倍，"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.historical.2","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":9,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7d84dab9c3f90ad11c84d196ac54ae3d4809dc2d3dcee190b33c2d60b3838a8b","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"解曰：甲乙丙丁两平行线内有甲丙丁戊方形乙丁丙角形同丙丁底题言方形倍大于角形"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"解释如下：在两条平行线之间 :甲乙丙丁，有正方形 甲丙丁戊 和 乙丁丙，和有相同底的三角形 丙丁。命题：正方形是三角形的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.historical.3","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":10,"kind":"historical_note","title":"徐光启、利玛窦历史中译 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d5337cfbe7d19a8ad8d28694b6ee4b6fb292ca216a0208207642cc21468aaa1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"historical-zh","role":"historical_source","language":"zh-Hans","status":"source_transcription","text":"论曰：试作甲丁直线分方形为两平分则甲丙丁与乙丁丙两角形等矣〈本篇卅七〉夫甲丙丁戊倍大于甲丙丁〈本篇卅三〉必倍大于乙丁丙"},{"id":"historical-modern-zh","role":"historical_machine_interpretation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"证明如下：实验上，直线 甲丁 将正方形分开，则三角形 甲丙丁 和 乙丁丙 相等。〈本篇卅七〉 甲丙丁戊 倍大于 甲丙丁 〈本篇卅三〉 必须大于 乙丁丙。"}]},{"id":"euclid-1-41.source","contentId":"euclid-1-41","revisionId":"euclid-1-41@raw-a495e4e0dd65f3dc","order":11,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"1776b88e2f5133302fb396b35b909d410deda26a9d4561530bd1f88aa1b43f9a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)\nHistorical Chinese source: https://zh.wikisource.org/zh-hans/幾何原本/卷一"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-1-41:euclid-1-37:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-41","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-41.proof.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-37","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:1.prop.41/","sourceLabel":"I. 37"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-1-41:euclid-1-34:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-1-41","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-1-41.proof.3"],"targetContentId":"euclid-1-34","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:gree